[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:Tommy's Breakfast]
[00:00.92]Lesson 117 | 第117课
[00:03.95]Tommy's breakfast | 汤米的早餐
[00:06.72]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音，然后回答这个问题。
[00:12.78]What does she mean by 'change' in the last sentence? | 在最后一句话中，她说的“零钱”是什么意思？
[00:20.22]When my husband was going into the dining room this morning, | 今天早上我丈夫走进饭厅时，
[00:27.00]he dropped some coins on the floor. | 他把一些硬币掉在地板上了。
[00:31.12]There were coins everywhere. | 到处都是硬币。
[00:34.72]We looked for them, but we could not find them all. | 我们找了找，但没有把它们全都找到。
[00:40.48]While we were having breakfast, | 我们吃早饭的时候，
[00:44.27]our little boy, Tommy, found two small coins on the floor. | 我们的小儿子汤米在地板上找到了两枚小硬币。
[00:52.00]He put them both into his mouth. | 他把两枚硬币都放进了嘴里。
[00:56.54]We both tried to get the coins, but it was too late. | 我们俩都想把硬币拿出来，但是太晚了。
[01:03.38]Tommy had already swallowed them! | 汤米已经把它们吞下去了！
[01:08.92]Late that morning, when I was doing the housework, | 早上晚些时候，我正在做家务时，
[01:15.08]My husband phoned me from the office. | 我丈夫从办公室给我打了个电话。
[01:19.52]'How's Tommy?' he asked. | “汤米怎么样了？”他问。
[01:23.28]'I don't know,' I answered, | “我不知道，”我回答说，
[01:26.76]'Tommy's been to the toilet three times this morning, but I haven't had any change yet!' | “今天上午汤米已经上过三次厕所了，但我还没见到有任何‘零钱’呢！”